    -- Settle a checkout its payer came back from; returns whether the membership is paid for.
    fail conflict "session-mismatch" unless Stripe says the session is this membership's  !net
    true at once if the membership is already paid
    a complete session with a subscription -> activate, with its customer or the stored one
    anything else -> false
  pub async fn activate(core, membership, customer_id, subscription_id) -> bool fails  !net !db !time  @268-334
    -- Record that a membership pays through a subscription and grant access, if it is paying for a
    -- period still running.
    read the subscription; false unless it is in good standing and its period ends after now  !net
    in one transaction, holding the relay lock joins bind invites under
      set it paid: Canceled if the subscription won't renew, else Active, with its period end
      with a pubkey: clear their notification and admit them as a Payment member
      an unbound invite: create_claim for its code, unless the invite as it stands now is bound
        the caller's copy may predate the join that spent it
    publish AccessChanged with what was published
